    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29432" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mogontĭăcum</span></b> ,
		i, n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a city of Germany</i>, the mod. <i>Mayence</i>, or <i>Mainz</i>,
